# Configuration archives and key material: an archive holds pf.jwk, the master key that decrypts every secret
# in it. None of these may be committed. An age identity has no fixed name; SECURITY.md says where it belongs.
data*.zip
*.jwk
pingfederate-system-keys.xml
*.jks
*.p12
*.pfx
*.lic

# Terraform state and variables carry the values they managed in plaintext.
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
.terraform/
